  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Enhancing the contribution of Small scale fisheries</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Create awarness among governments and other stakeholders at global, regional and national level on the contribution of small-scale fisheries to food security and poverty reduction and on the application of the SSF Guidelines to support the development of sectoral and cross-sectoral policy frameworks and investment plans and programmes.  The guidelines has been developed through a participatory process initiated by FAO. Women&apos;s empowerment in small-scale fisheries emerged during the process.</narrative>
  </description>
